File surface amended (claim 6947880022, PR #34847 head `cd86ab2d2`), on the dev's measured read (report 6949609138):

- added `packages/plugins/plugin-audit/src/audit-plugin.ts` — registers the code-declared mention e-mail templates;
- added `packages/plugins/plugin-audit/package.json`, `pnpm-lock.yaml` (+3 lines) and `packages/plugins/plugin-audit/vitest.config.ts` — a `@objectstack/service-messaging` devDependency aliased to source for the integration test;
- no `packages/services/service-messaging/**` code changed.

Route change from the claim's suggestion: two emits (the unchanged per-comment inbox emit, plus an `['email']` emit deduplicated per organization, person and clock-aligned 10-minute window) instead of one `['inbox','email']` emit, because the event `dedup_key` is messaging's only durable per-window claim and the inbox key must stay per comment. `Clause-②: no`, `Metadata-protocol: none` unchanged. Not governed (check-governed-merges: 0 of 14 paths, 640 lines).
